349	\item \textbf{LOG:} Set for a logarithmic sweep (only for frequency, power adjustment during the sweep is always linear)
350	\item \textbf{FP:} Fixed power setting. This must be disabled for power sweeps (when  cdbm\_excitation\_start $\neq$  cdbm\_excitation\_stop)
351	\begin{center}
352	\begin{tabularx}{\textwidth}{ c|X }
353	Setting & Behavior\\
354	 \hline
355	0 & Attenuator setting is fixed during the sweep. This will result in inaccurate stimulus level but prevent discrete jumps in output power. \\
