1063	\subsection{FrequencyCorrection}
1064	This packet contains the frequency correction factor for the internal reference. It can be transmitted in both directions. When reading the frequency correction, it is transmitted from the device to the host. When writing the frequency correction, it is transmitted from the host to the device.
1065	
1066	The packet contains the following fields:
